Why this licence
----------------

This is not a stylistic choice. The PS4 packages are built with the OpenOrbis
PS4 toolchain and LibOrbisPkg, both GPL-3.0. Distributing binaries produced with
them carries the GPL's obligation to make the corresponding source available, so
this project is offered under the same terms instead of a licence that could not
honestly be satisfied.

Third-party components keep their own licences and are not relicensed by this
file. See NOTICE.md for the list, and for what this repository deliberately does
not contain.

What this licence does not grant
--------------------------------

No Sony code, firmware or key is included or licensed here. The console's drive
key is read at runtime from the running console's own kernel; nothing of Sony's
is stored or redistributed. ChromeOS Flex is not redistributable and is not part
of this project. Using this software requires a console you own and are entitled
to modify; that is your responsibility, not something this licence speaks to.
